  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 4.3 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "To get the size usage of a background asset, reference the `usedBytes` attribute on `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/BackgroundAsset/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To specify the initial `gameCenterChallengeVersion` when creating a challenge, call `POST-v1-gameCenterChallenges` using `GameCenterChallengeVersionInlineCreate`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterChallenges",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterChallengeVersionInlineCreate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To specify the initial `gameCenterActivityVersion` when creating an activity, call `POST-v1-gameCenterActivities` using `GameCenterActivityVersionInlineCreate`. You can also specify a `fallbackUrl` for the initial activity version during the operation.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterActivities",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GameCenterActivityVersionInlineCreate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the `preReleased` attribute with `POST-v1-gameCenterPlayerAchievementSubmissions` and `POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardEntrySubmissions` to indicate whether the requested change applies to the game’s release version or its prerelease version.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterPlayerAchievementSubmissions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardEntrySubmissions"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The user role permission `ACCESS_TO_REPORTS` for App Store Connect API is deprecated.  See `UserRole` for available alternatives.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/UserRole"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Removed the endpoints `GET /v1/appStoreVersions/{id}/relationships/ageRatingDeclaration` and `GET /v1/appStoreVersions/{id}/ageRatingDeclaration`. Use `GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-ageRatingDeclaration` instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-ageRatingDeclaration"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
